[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000200_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000200_01_0010","text":"……话说今天\n你走路是不是比平时慢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000200_01_0020","text":"啊—\n第六节课，是马拉松来着"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000200_01_0030","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000200_01_0040","text":"跑了\n超——级多"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000200_01_0050","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000200_01_0060","text":"跑着跑着，听到了\n雏菜的声音"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000200_01_0070","text":"在给我加油\n喊着加油—"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000200_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000200_01_0080","text":"雏菜明明也应该在课上才对呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000200_01_0090","text":"啊——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000200_01_0100","text":"………………"}]
